<title>UK: Argentina's IMPSA sets $150 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Argentina's IMPSA sets $150 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Bear Stearns and Salomon.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INDUSTRIAS METALURGICAS PESCARMONA SAICYF (IMPSA)</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     9.50	MATURITY    31.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.512    PAY DATE  L-30.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    99.512    SPREAD	+303 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG LAST COUPON</p>
</text>
